{"id":"n31773-1-10","stage":3,"title":"제공 · 提供","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31773-1-10-1","ko":"밥 먹고 그곳에 갑시다.","zh":"吃完饭咱们再去那儿吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그곳에","meaning":"那儿，那里","explanation":"그곳：那儿，那里；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"그곳","audio":"/audio/093e0b955cac928053f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17207","senseId":"2","lemma":"그곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갑시다.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"093e0b955cac9280","term":"그곳","zh":"那儿，那里","audio":"/audio/093e0b955cac928053f8.mp3","entryId":"17207","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的地方。","pronunciation":["그곧"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/666c413bcc392f3ca392.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31773-1-10-2","ko":"그곳에서 식사 제공을 한다고 하니 그냥 가면 돼요.","zh":"听说那儿会提供餐食，直接过去就行了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그곳에서","meaning":"那儿，那里","explanation":"그곳：那儿，那里；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"그곳","audio":"/audio/093e0b955cac928053f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17207","senseId":"2","lemma":"그곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식사","meaning":"用餐，就餐，餐","explanation":"식사：用餐，就餐，餐","readings":[{"term":"식사","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29596","senseId":"1","lemma":"식사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제공을","meaning":"提供","explanation":"제공：提供；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"제공","audio":"/audio/9575d098ac659c8d2c77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31773","senseId":"1","lemma":"제공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한다고","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하니","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가면","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"093e0b955cac9280","term":"그곳","zh":"那儿，那里","audio":"/audio/093e0b955cac928053f8.mp3","entryId":"17207","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的地方。","pronunciation":["그곧"]},{"id":"0f82e313dadba4d8","term":"식사","zh":"用餐，就餐，餐","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3","entryId":"29596","definition":"像早餐、午餐、晚餐那样每天在固定时间吃饭；或指那时吃的食物。","pronunciation":["식싸"]},{"id":"9575d098ac659c8d","term":"제공","zh":"提供","audio":"/audio/9575d098ac659c8d2c77.mp3","entryId":"31773","definition":"交出或带来某物。","pronunciation":["제공"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ffe64c0565c0d06f8988.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.678,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31773","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":118,"sequenceScore":3.1547,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说那儿会提供餐食，直接过去就行了。","吃完饭咱们再去那儿吧。","你要穿西装去打扫吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["吃完饭咱们再去那儿吧。","你要穿西装去打扫吗？","听说那儿会提供餐食，直接过去就行了。"],"answer":2}]}
